{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mic-3-1","title":"Micah 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The cruelty of the princes. 5 The falsehood of the prophets. 8 The ill-grounded security of them both.</p>\n<p>Cir. A.M. 3294. B.C. 710. Hear. 9,10; Isa 1:10; Jer 13:15-18; 22:2,3; Ho 5:1; Am 4:1 Is it. De 1:13-17; 16:18; 2Ch 19:5-10; Ps 14:4; 82:1-5; Jer 5:4,5; 1Co 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-2","title":"Micah 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>hate. 1Ki 21:20; 22:6-8; Am 5:10-14; Lu 19:14; Joh 7:7; 15:18,19,23,24 Ac 7:51,52; Ro 12:9; 2Ti 3:3 love. 2Ch 19:2; Ps 15:4; 139:21,22; Pr 28:4; Joh 18:40; Ro 1:32 pluck. Ps 53:4; Isa 3:15; Eze 22:27; 34:3; Am 8:4-6; Zep 3:3; Zec 11:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-3","title":"Micah 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>eat. Ps 14:4 and chop. Eze 11:3,6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-4","title":"Micah 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Then. 2:3,4; Jer 5:31 cry. Ps 18:41; Pr 1:28; 28:9; Isa 1:15; Jer 2:27,28; Eze 8:18; Zec 7:13 Mt 7:22; Lu 13:25; Joh 9:31; Jas 2:13 he will even. De 31:17,18; 32:19,20; Isa 59:1-15; Jer 33:5 as. Isa 3:11; Ro 2:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-5","title":"Micah 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>concerning. 11; Isa 9:15,16; Jer 14:14,15; 23:9-17,27,32; 28:15-17; 29:21-23 Eze 13:10-16; 22:25-29; Mal 2:8; Mt 15:14 that bite. 2:11; Isa 56:9-12; Eze 13:18,19; Mt 7:15; Ro 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-6","title":"Micah 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>night. Ps 74:9; Isa 8:20-22; Jer 13:16; Eze 13:22,23; Zec 13:2-4 that ye shall not have a vision. Heb. from a vision. that yeshall not divine. Heb. from divining. the sun. Isa 29:10; 59:10; Jer 15:9; Am 8:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-7","title":"Micah 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the seers. Ex 8:18,19; 9:11; 1Sa 9:9; Isa 44:25; 47:12-14; Da 2:9-11; Zec 13:4 2Ti 3:8,9 cover. Le 13:45; Eze 24:17,22 lips. Heb. upper lip. no. 1Sa 14:37; 28:6,15; Ps 74:9; Am 8:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-8","title":"Micah 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I am. Job 32:18; Isa 11:2,3; 58:1; Jer 1:18; 6:11; 15:19-21; 20:9; Eze 3:14 Mt 7:29; Mr 3:17; Ac 4:8-12,19,20; 7:54-57; 13:9-12; 18:5,6,9-11 1Co 2:4,12,13 to declare. Isa 58:1; Eze 16:2; 20:4; 22:2; 43:10; Mt 3:7-12; Ac 7:51,52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-9","title":"Micah 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I pray. 1; Ex 3:16; Ho 5:1 that. Le 26:15; De 27:19; Ps 58:1,2; Pr 17:15; Isa 1:23; Jer 5:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-10","title":"Micah 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>build up Zion. Jer 22:13-17; Eze 22:25-28; Hab 2:9-12; Zep 3:3; Mt 27:25 Joh 11:50 blood. Heb. bloods.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-11","title":"Micah 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>heads. 7:3; Nu 16:15; 1Sa 8:3; 12:3,4; Isa 1:23; Eze 22:12,27; Ho 4:18 Zep 3:3 and the priests. Jer 6:13; 8:10; Mal 1:10; 1Ti 3:3; Tit 1:11; 1Pe 5:2 and the prophets. 5; Isa 56:11; Ac 8:18-20; 2Pe 2:1-3,14,15; Jude 1:11 yet. 1Sa 4:3-6; Isa 48:2; Jer 7:4,8-12; Mt 3:9; Ro 2:17-29 and say. Heb. saying. none evil can come. Am 9:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mic-3-12","title":"Micah 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MIC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Zion. 1:6; Ps 79:1; 107:34; Jer 26:18; Mt 24:2; Ac 6:13,14 the mountain. 4:1,2; Isa 2:2,3</p>"}]}